# The encodes themselves. The SOURCE is the deliverable: every one of these is
# reproducible with `node capture.mjs <page.html> && node assemble.mjs <out>`,
# and megabytes of h264 in git history is not worth what it buys.
#
# nomad-anim.mp4 was the exception and is no longer: at 6.6MB it was ~90% of a
# 7.3MB repository, on its own, while 270 migrations and the whole game server
# shared the other megabyte. Untracked 2026-08-23 (it stays on disk, and
# nomad-anim.html rebuilds it). The blob is still in history -- clearing that
# needs a rewrite and a force-push, which is a decision to take deliberately
# and once, for everything, not as a side effect of tidying.
*.mp4
